WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:14.040
Smart setup: the assistant reads your website, your Instagram page, past conversations and your media library, and proposes prices, common questions, and which photo belongs to which product.

2
00:00:14.587 --> 00:00:21.350
Pick the sources: website, Instagram page, past conversations and media library.

3
00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:25.600
Click Start the smart setup, and wait for the proposals.

4
00:00:26.149 --> 00:00:32.830
Read each proposal, and accept only the correct ones. Nothing is added without your approval.

5
00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:41.420
Turn on the Nightly update, so new changes are proposed every night. And check old prices from posts before accepting them.
